What does this program print?

```csharp
static string Classify(int[] xs) => xs switch
{
    [] => "empty",
    [var only] => $"one: {only}",
    [var first, .., var last] when first == last => "same ends",
    [_, _] => "pair",
    [.., > 100] => "ends big",
    _ => "other",
};
Console.WriteLine(string.Join(" | ", new[] { Classify([4, 1, 4]), Classify([1, 2]), Classify([1, 2, 300]), Classify([7]) }));
```

